<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.nexus.composes ~ a rite orders primitives; it holds no behaviour of its own

`lares nexus rite <petname>` runs one pet-named procedure over the nexus primitives (`quorum` seats the kahu quorum on this node so the Nexus stands ready to contract; `kahuli` composes the overturn). Bare, it lists the rites; an unknown petname exits 2.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ quorum

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`quorum` params=`petname/quorum ~ seat the quorum`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ petname

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`petname` params=`takes/name seat/1 as/<petname> ~ the rite`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ quorum

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`quorum` params=`who/hand key/seat ~ each primitive keeps its own gate`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[realm.nexus.composes petname/quorum]] ~ no rite of that petname`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ ran

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`ran` params=`exit/0 ~ the rite's primitives ran`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares nexus rite

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares nexus rite]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~/ahu>>

